.env
backend/target/
parser/target/
# Where the backend keeps demo files when STORAGE_TYPE=local (the default); see backend/src/main/resources/application.yml
backend/data/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
recorder/node_modules/
recorder/dist/
# The work directory of a recorder started by hand (see recorder/README.md): cached demos and the scratch of a clip
recorder/work/
# A real demo and its stubs for the fake FACEIT (see dev/fake-faceit/README.md); demos are large and never committed. The
# stubs that dev/fake-faceit/local-match.sh writes (mappings/local-match.json) hold the SteamIDs of the demo's real players,
# which are personal data: nothing that matches local-*.json is ever committed, and the script refuses to write where git
# would not ignore it.
dev/fake-faceit/__files/demos/local.dem
dev/fake-faceit/mappings/local-*.json
# Its bzip2 copy, which the fake serves as the replay of every matchmaking match the fake bridge names
# (mappings/valve-replays.json; made with `bzip2 -k dev/fake-faceit/__files/demos/local.dem`).
dev/fake-faceit/__files/demos/local.dem.bz2
